1
00:00:00,146 --> 00:00:03,646
(Sheldon:)Dear Lord, are you still going
to be here on French toast day?

2
00:00:07,987 --> 00:00:09,027
(Penny:)Morning.

3
00:00:09,197 --> 00:00:12,037
(Sheldon:)Look, Leonard,
Penny made French toast.

4
00:00:12,200 --> 00:00:14,410
(Leonard:)Sorry, I haven't given her
your schedule yet.

5
00:00:14,577 --> 00:00:17,787
(Sheldon:)It's an iCal download.
She can put it right in her phone.

6
00:00:19,332 --> 00:00:22,122
And we agreed you'd have
conjugal visits in her apartment.

7
00:00:22,585 --> 00:00:25,255
(Leonard:)We did, but there
were extenuating circumstances.

8
00:00:25,421 --> 00:00:29,341
(Sheldon:)I see. Did her abysmal housekeeping
skills finally trump her perkiness?

9
00:00:31,385 --> 00:00:34,725
No, her bed kind of broke.

10
00:00:36,516 --> 00:00:40,266
(Sheldon:)That doesn't seem likely.
Her bed's of sturdy construction.

11
00:00:40,436 --> 00:00:42,896
(Sheldon:)Even the addition
of a second normal-sized human...

12
00:00:43,064 --> 00:00:47,694
...wouldn't cause a structural failure,
much less a homunculus such as yourself.

13
00:00:48,402 --> 00:00:49,652
(Penny:)A homunculus?

14
00:00:49,821 --> 00:00:53,071
(Leonard:)Perfectly formed miniature human being.

15
00:00:53,658 --> 00:00:57,448
(Penny:)Oh, you're my little homunculus.

16
00:00:57,995 --> 00:00:59,035
(Leonard:)Don't do that.

